<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>LET THE JUDGE JUDGE ME TOO</title>
    
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css" />
    
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #0a0a0a;
            --accent: #d4af37; 
            --text: #e0e0e0;
            --panel: #1a1a1a;
        }

        body, html {
            margin: 0; padding: 0;
            height: 100%; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
            background-color: var(--primary); color: var(--text);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        header {
            height: 22vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--accent);
            padding: 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #000, #1a1a1a);
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            letter-spacing: 6px;
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--accent);
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .poetry {
            font-style: italic;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin-top: 15px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #aaa;
        }

        #main-container {
            display: flex;
            height: 78vh;
        }

        #sidebar {
            width: 350px;
            background: var(--panel);
            overflow-y: auto;
            border-right: 1px solid #333;
        }

        .search-box {
            padding: 15px;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            background: var(--panel);
            z-index: 10;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #333;
        }

        #church-list {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0; margin: 0;
        }

        .church-item {
            padding: 15px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #222;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .church-item:hover {
            background: #252525;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
        }

        #map { flex-grow: 1; height: 100%; }

        /* Custom Popup Styling */
        .leaflet-popup-content-wrapper {
            background: #111;
            color: #fff;
            border: 1px solid var(--accent);
            border-radius: 0;
        }
        .leaflet-popup-tip { background: var(--accent); }
        .popup-header { color: var(--accent); font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 5px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>LET THE JUDGE JUDGE ME TOO</h1>
    <div class="poetry">
        "In a land and sea beyond life on earth, like a vessel charting the unchosen birth,<br>
        born in to write or be written on earth; a soul's weight measured in poetic justice.<br>
        For every spire is a pen, and every congregation a verse in the silent comparison of life."
    </div>
</header>

<div id="main-container">
    <div id="sidebar">
        <div class="search-box">
            <input type="text" id="search" placeholder="Filter locations..." 
                   style="width: 100%; padding: 10px; background: #000; color: var(--accent); border: 1px solid #444;">
        </div>
        <ul id="church-list"></ul>
    </div>
    <div id="map"></div>
</div>

<script src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js"></script>

